  "details": "A future where we can have auto translate for text in vrchat.\n\nSuch a feature can improve the overall social functionality of the game \n\nFor reading text in worlds to auto translate for speech to text or any chat box use.\n\nIt would be an interesting step forward for language boundaries.\n\nEven if it mostly worked, it is better than having none. \n\nTaking it even further and have lets say add magnifying glass feature to the game that could read any text and write in a more of a clear font for the user and can as well auto translate or read it back for more accessibility.\n\nI hope such a feature can be considered in the future. Thanks for reading.",
